# SSOI versus BibMon

This package does not import BibMon. Training, scalers, and `VirtualSensor`
stay here. Outage detection, PreProcess, SPE, alarms, and plant policy stay
in BibMon.

Do not implement SSOI as `ModeloGenerico`. Do not vendor BibMon source.

Send engineering-unit auxiliaries into `VirtualSensor`; the bundle owns TCDR
scaling. Canonical spec: BibMon `doc/SSOI_BIBMON.md`.
